[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089469481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108737#issuecomment-3089469481","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108737","id":3089469481,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64JZAp","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T13:21:11Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T13:21:11Z","body":"Thanks, this is a really great idea! I love using `scrcpy` :-)\r\n\r\nI tested on my phone (Samsung  S21 Ultra) and it worked, but I have two notes:\r\n\r\n- Having these settings on the export preset doesn't feel quite right. They aren't really settings for export, because if I do a plain export, it doesn't run `scrcpy` - it's only when you use the \"Remote Deploy\" button that it does something. Also, if I've got multiple Android presets (which I frequently do when targeting different standalone VR headsets), I don't really want to configure this differently for each one. So, maybe this would be better in Project Settings or even Editor Settings?\r\n- If I disable only \"Virtual Display\", then `scrcpy` won't start, and gives this error to the terminal that I launched Godot from:\r\n  ```\r\n  scrcpy 3.3.1 <https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy>\r\n  ERROR: --display-ime-policy is only supported on a secondary display\r\n  ```\r\n  I need to also disable \"Local Ime\" for it to start correctly. Two things about this:\r\n    - Disabling \"Virtual Display\" should probably automatically disable \"Local Ime\"\r\n    - The error from `scrcpy` should be exposed in the editor somewhere, not just printed to the terminal that launched Godot, or at least give some indication in the editor that there was an error running `scrcpy`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089469481/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089595990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108737#issuecomment-3089595990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108737","id":3089595990,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64J35W","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T14:07:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T14:07:33Z","body":"I would put scrcpy-related settings in the Editor Settings, as you probably won't share them with other team members. You'll likely want to use different video quality arguments depending on whether you're using a wired or wireless connection, a different resolution according to the target device and so on.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089595990/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089716428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108737#issuecomment-3089716428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108737","id":3089716428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64KVTM","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T14:40:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T14:40:21Z","body":"I don’t see any real benefit to adding this to core. scrcpy already works fine without integration, and adding to core feels unnecessary to me. We should first evaluate whether it really needs to be part of the editor at all.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089716428/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089732160","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108737#issuecomment-3089732160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108737","id":3089732160,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64KZJA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T14:45:09Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T14:45:09Z","body":"> scrcpy already works fine without integration\r\n\r\nIt is usable without integration, but this is at least 3 action: export, install, run vs. one click from the editor with integration.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089732160/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089839297","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108737#issuecomment-3089839297","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108737","id":3089839297,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64KzTB","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T15:23:04Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T15:24:45Z","body":"> I don’t see any real benefit to adding this to core. scrcpy already works fine without integration, and adding to core feels unnecessary to me. We should first evaluate whether it really needs to be part of the editor at all.\n\n@syntaxerror247 I can see value in adding the feature to core; it is similar to [Android Studio device streaming feature](https://developer.android.com/studio/run/device#device-mirroring), and core integration would make it easier for users to discover and use.\n\nI agree that some of the settings should be moved to the editor settings but I think whether or not it's enabled should be device specific. For example on mobile VR devices, the feature may be able to mirror the screen, but keyboard interactions are unlikely to work. \nSo the feature should include a toggle in the remote deploy device selection drop-down to dictate whether or not the feature should be enabled.\n\nAnother TODO after we aligned on this PR is to update the Android documentation to describe the feature and provide instructions for setting it up.\n\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089839297/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089900313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108737#issuecomment-3089900313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108737","id":3089900313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64LCMZ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T15:44:18Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T15:45:00Z","body":"Since the most useful part (at least for me) is different virtual screen configs (quickly testing with phone and tablet dimensions on the same device), it might be worth adding editor settings for adding multiple run presets and show these as items (or submenu) of the one-click run menu. This should also allow adding device filters for each profile.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089900313/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3091911695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108737#issuecomment-3091911695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108737","id":3091911695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64StQP","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-19T05:57:57Z","updated_at":"2025-07-19T06:12:09Z","body":"> It is usable without integration, but this is at least 3 action: export, install, run vs. one click from the editor with integration.\r\n\r\n> @syntaxerror247 I can see value in adding the feature to core; it is similar to [Android Studio device streaming feature](https://developer.android.com/studio/run/device#device-mirroring), and core integration would make it easier for users to discover and use.\r\n\r\nI get the point that it makes things easier to use, but I feel that integrating this feature directly into the editor might make it seem like the recommended way to test apps, which I don't think is ideal. I sometimes use `scrcpy` to test with different dpi, but most of the time I prefer running the app directly on my device, as it gives me a better sense of how it actually feels.\r\n\r\nI still think it's better to keep this as an optional tool rather than part of the editor.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3091911695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3091932608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108737#issuecomment-3091932608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108737","id":3091932608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64SyXA","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-19T06:19:47Z","updated_at":"2025-07-19T06:20:28Z","body":"Giving it more thoughts: if we do include this feature, it should be easier to toggle. Adding a \"Use scrcpy\" checkbox at the top of the submenu that appears when clicking the `Remote Deploy` button would be better.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3091932608/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3092416363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108737#issuecomment-3092416363","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108737","id":3092416363,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64Uodr","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https:/